    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Do you think being fat can be a good thing? In Alaska, it sure is! Every year since 2014, the park has held an online event called Fat Bear Week. People all over the world "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "vote for",
            "ref": "v-vote-for"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the bear that has gained the most "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "weight",
            "ref": "v-weight"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " before winter. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "contest",
            "ref": "v-contest"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is fun. But it also shows how important "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fat",
            "zh": "脂肪"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is for bears to survive."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This year’s winner is a huge brown bear named Chunk. At the start of summer, Chunk had a broken jaw, and many viewers worried he wouldn’t be able to eat. But Chunk surprised everyone. He kept eating "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "salmon",
            "zh": "三文鱼"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from the Brooks River and grew bigger and bigger."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Brown bears must eat a lot before winter because they "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "hibernate"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for several months. During this time, they do not move or eat, so they lose a lot of weight. To survive, they need to be as fat as possible."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Thanks to the thousands of salmon swimming upstream, Chunk had plenty of food. Viewers saw his amazing change through "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "live",
            "zh": "实况转播的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " “"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bear cams",
            "zh": "摄像头"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "”. They "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "compared",
            "ref": "v-compare"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " his “before” and “after” photos and voted for him again and again. Now Chunk weighs about 544 kilograms. He is not just the winner of Fat Bear Week—he is a true survivor."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
